- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1810.07462/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1810.07462/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The family uses the paper’s native exact vector-matroid objects and inverse-generates disjoint transversal bases. All local gates pass, including:

- G4: 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses.
- G6: five attacks at 0/8; reference algorithm solves 8/8.
- Reference cost: 11,772 operations versus a 152-operation compact route.
- G8: 20/20 relabelling invariance and 20/20 distinct unrelated keys.
- G9: 283-character worst-case answer, 108 atoms.

The required oracle hardening remains unscored: every bare, hinted, and placebo request was rejected by OpenRouter with HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded.” The error-only transcripts are retained and are not misrepresented as model failures. The family should not be submitted as hardened until those runs can be repeated with restored quota.
